Alembic migrations for the Voice Tutor LMS backend.

Create a migration after changing models in app/models/:

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add courses and modules"

Apply migrations:

    alembic upgrade head

Roll back one:

    alembic downgrade -1

env.py reads DATABASE_URL from backend/.env via app.core.config, so
alembic.ini holds no connection string.

Note: pgvector needs `CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector;` before any
Vector column is used. On Neon/Supabase run it once from their SQL console, or
put it in the first migration's upgrade().
